d 3D assets","alt","Recording type","Original project recording","role","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Related project",[90],"resourceId",{"_49":91,"_26":92},"TRELLIS","/resources/trellis/","What this recording shows","Official generated-asset examples; gameplay, rigging and runtime integration are not demonstrated.","limitations","Demo category","Asset generation","demoType","lead","source-recording","3d","assets","recordingId","trellis","resource:trellis","resource","Generates meshes, Gaussians, and radiance fields from structured latent representations.","/resources/",{"_20":104,"_179":91,"_177":101,"_47":180,"_178":107,"_172":171,"_26":132,"_57":181,"_157":182,"_153":183,"_150":184,"_144":185,"_141":140},[112,113,114,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_47":22,"_51":91,"_53":179,"_55":-7},{"_47":99,"_51":107,"_53":178,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":175,"_51":176,"_53":177,"_55":86},{"_47":48,"_49":173,"_51":174,"_53":47,"_55":86},{"_47":48,"_49":170,"_51":171,"_53":172,"_55":56},{"_47":57,"_49":167,"_59":168,"_53":26,"_55":-7},{"_47":57,"_49":162,"_59":163,"_53":57,"_55":-7},{"_47":145,"_49":155,"_147":148,"_59":156,"_53":157,"_55":-7},{"_47":145,"_49":151,"_147":148,"_59":152,"_53":153,"_55":-7},{"_47":145,"_49":146,"_147":148,"_59":149,"_53":150,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":142,"_51":143,"_53":144,"_55":86},{"_47":48,"_49":139,"_51":140,"_53":141,"_55":86},{"_47":136,"_53":137,"_49":138,"_70":72,"_78":77,"_33":63,"_54":52},{"_47":48,"_53":133,"_49":134,"_51":135},{"_47":57,"_53":127,"_49":128,"_59":129},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[130],{"_49":131,"_26":132},"Microsoft","https://github.com/microsoft/TRELLIS","identity","Identity & attribution","The official research repository is hosted by Microsoft's organization. The asset is from Microsoft's official brand page and identifies the organization rather than fabricating a TRELLIS project mark.","image","projectMedia","Creator project media","Sourc